# Reference screenshots/photos dropped into the working directory for review.
# These routinely show real client data, and this repository is public, so the
# rule is by EXTENSION rather than by filename -- an IMG_* pattern missed
# anything saved as Screenshot..., a pasted image, or a phone default name.
# The repo tracks no images of its own (verified), so a blanket ignore costs
# nothing. Force-add with `git add -f` if a diagram ever genuinely belongs here.
*.JPG
*.jpg
*.JPEG
*.jpeg
*.PNG
*.png
*.GIF
*.gif
*.WEBP
*.webp
*.HEIC
